    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d898">

                <pb facs="0947" n="935" sameAs="frus:frus1941v01/pg935"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">360M.1121 Devenis, Michael: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-02-15T14:00:00+03:00">February 15,
                            1941—2 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received February 15—12:14 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>285. Department’s 176, February 13, 7 p.m.<anchor n="26" xml:id="d898-f1"/> I am
                    today addressing a further note to the Commissariat for Foreign Affairs in the
                    Devenis case. Thus far, I have had no indication that the Soviet authorities
                    intend to recede from their position that Devenis is now a Soviet citizen
                    irrespective of our claim that he is an American citizen.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d898-f1" n="26" xml:id="d898-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; the Department asked for a report of results of efforts so far made
                    in behalf of Devenis because a “number of communications” was being received
                    inquiring about this case.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
